{"id":"plan-fields","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"concept-strict-plan-schema","question":"严格 Task Schema 包含哪些字段？","aliases":["Agent计划需要保存什么"],"keywords":["Task Schema","Agent计划","字段"],"diagnostic":"检查ID、动作、依赖、预算、状态和尝试。","hints":["查看 #concept-strict-plan-schema。","动作必须白名单。"],"example":"task_id/action/depends_on/budget/status/attempts。","answer":"包含task_id、白名单action、depends_on、正整数budget、status和attempts。","source":{"label":"严格计划Schema","href":"#concept-strict-plan-schema"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"planner-no-code","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"concept-strict-plan-schema","question":"为什么 Planner 不能输出可执行代码？","aliases":["计划里的shell命令能直接运行吗"],"keywords":["Planner","可执行代码","shell命令"],"diagnostic":"检查输出是否映射白名单动作。","hints":["查看 #concept-strict-plan-schema。","计划是数据。"],"example":"shell action被拒绝。","answer":"Planner输出不可信；它只能给结构化任务，由应用映射到已授权动作，不能直接执行代码。","source":{"label":"严格计划Schema","href":"#concept-strict-plan-schema"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"plan-limits","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"concept-strict-plan-schema","question":"计划需要哪些数量预算？","aliases":["怎样防止Agent无限拆任务"],"keywords":["计划","数量预算","Agent","无限拆任务"],"diagnostic":"检查max_tasks和total_budget。","hints":["查看 #concept-strict-plan-schema。","服务端校验。"],"example":"6 tasks, total 12。","answer":"限制最大任务数、每项预算和总预算；本课最多6项、总预算12。","source":{"label":"严格计划Schema","href":"#concept-strict-plan-schema"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"ready-set","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"concept-dependency-and-ready","question":"什么任务可以进入 ready set？","aliases":["pending任务都能执行吗"],"keywords":["ready set","pending任务","执行"],"diagnostic":"检查全部依赖是否completed。","hints":["查看 #concept-dependency-and-ready。","数组顺序不是依赖。"],"example":"pending && deps completed。","answer":"只有状态为pending且全部依赖已completed的任务可以进入。","source":{"label":"依赖与就绪任务","href":"#concept-dependency-and-ready"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"cycle-reject","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"concept-dependency-and-ready","question":"依赖图出现环时怎么办？","aliases":["任务A等B而B等A能运行吗"],"keywords":["依赖图","环","任务A","任务B"],"diagnostic":"检查DAG校验。","hints":["查看 #concept-dependency-and-ready。","计划阶段拒绝。"],"example":"dependency_cycle。","answer":"在执行前拒绝整个计划；环会导致没有合法ready任务。","source":{"label":"依赖与就绪任务","href":"#concept-dependency-and-ready"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"retryable-failure","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"example-failure-replan","question":"哪些故障可以有界重试？","aliases":["timeout和permission denied都能重试吗"],"keywords":["故障","有界重试","timeout","permission denied"],"diagnostic":"检查稳定失败分类。","hints":["查看 #example-failure-replan。","重试消耗预算。"],"example":"timeout retryable。","answer":"临时超时、暂时不可用和lease丢失可在预算内重试；权限拒绝和安全错误直接终止。","source":{"label":"故障与重规划","href":"#example-failure-replan"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"completed-immutable","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"example-failure-replan","question":"重规划为什么不能改写已完成任务？","aliases":["replan能重新做completed任务吗"],"keywords":["重规划","已完成任务","replan","completed"],"diagnostic":"检查完成事实和副作用。","hints":["查看 #example-failure-replan。","只替换未完成部分。"],"example":"completed_task_immutable。","answer":"已完成任务是运行事实，改写会导致结果和副作用重复；重规划只能替换未完成部分。","source":{"label":"故障与重规划","href":"#example-failure-replan"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"parallel-budget","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"modify-add-parallel-budget","question":"增加并行执行要保留哪些边界？","aliases":["ready任务可以全部并发吗"],"keywords":["并行执行","边界","ready任务","并发"],"diagnostic":"检查max_parallel、审批和独立记账。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-parallel-budget。","依赖不变。"],"example":"max_parallel=2。","answer":"限制并行数，只从ready set选择，高风险任务仍审批，失败与预算分别记账。","source":{"label":"增加并发预算","href":"#modify-add-parallel-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"no-ready","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"troubleshoot-task-planning","question":"任务都 pending 却没有 ready 项先查什么？","aliases":["计划为什么无法调度"],"keywords":["pending","ready","计划","调度"],"diagnostic":"检查环和缺失依赖。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-task-planning。","验证图而非数组。"],"example":"cycle or unknown dependency。","answer":"先检查依赖环、未知依赖或依赖状态未正确提交。","source":{"label":"任务计划排错","href":"#troubleshoot-task-planning"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"planner-eval","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"deepen-planner-evaluation","question":"怎样评估任务计划质量？","aliases":["计划越长越智能吗"],"keywords":["任务计划质量","计划越长","智能"],"diagnostic":"检查合法性、覆盖、冗余、依赖和预算。","hints":["查看 #deepen-planner-evaluation。","长度不是质量。"],"example":"valid rate + redundancy。","answer":"评估Schema合法率、必要步骤覆盖、冗余率、依赖正确、预算超限、重规划和副作用重复。","source":{"label":"计划质量评估","href":"#deepen-planner-evaluation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"plan-trace","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v33","question":"计划 trace 应保存什么？","aliases":["任务规划需要记录思维链吗"],"keywords":["计划trace","保存","任务规划","思维链"],"diagnostic":"检查revision、依赖、预算、结果和失败码。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v33。","不存自由推理。"],"example":"revision/action/status/error。","answer":"保存版本、结构化任务、依赖、预算、状态、结果和失败码，不保存自由文本思维链。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.33","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v33"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
{"id":"assistant-v33","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-03","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v33","question":"智能学习助手 v0.33 新增什么？","aliases":["Agent应用编排第三课做什么"],"keywords":["智能学习助手","v0.33","Agent应用编排第三课"],"diagnostic":"定位任务规划增量。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v33。","运行8项测试。"],"example":"DAG和重规划。","answer":"新增严格计划Schema、DAG/ready set、故障分类、尝试预算、revision和完成事实不可变。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.33","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v33"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false}]}
